<title>USA: GalaGen names Watson as COO.</title>
<headline>GalaGen names Watson as COO.</headline>
<dateline>ARDEN HILLS, Minn. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>GalaGen Inc said Thursday it named John Watson to the newly created position of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He previously was chief operating officer at Vestar Inc, which is now NeXstar Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
<p>	  -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
